														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1674450">
									

<p>It's great, but I think it's heading for the big question: if it's this easy for people to create anomalous art, what are the odds that the SCP Foundation knows *much* more about how to do it than it's letting on?</p>
<p>I'm now imagining some super-black projects to create anart (maybe just to learn more about how it's done) that the researchers aren't allowed to know about&#8230;</p>

