			<div class="content" id="post-content-1671938">
									

<p>Now then, now that I've finally figured out this blasted Wikidot syntax, I can speak of it.</p>
<p>This was based on a post I made months ago in that big AWCY thread, and was fleshed out as a result of my sorta disappointment that everyone always jumps to AWCY every time anomalous art is featured. Like, you could have a caveman whose paintings come to life and people would go &quot;hey, its the beginning of AWCY.&quot; There's so much more to be done with anomalous art than a bunch of bored hipster Petty and True Reconstructionists and Pseudo-Deconstructionists.</p>

