			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1671955">
									

<p>I remember that post! It was one of the most productive things to come out of that already-productive thread. Also, I appreciate the &quot;AWCY? is not the end-all-be-all of anart&quot; (&quot;anart&quot; is totally a term I'm going to use!) +1</p>
<p>That said, I have a couple of problems with this. First, there are a few minor grammar hiccups. Second, it still feels like it needs more expansion. One fairly cut-and-dry sentence to describe the majority of these definitions feels a bit abrupt. While the idea of the Foundation just kind of giving blanket terms to various movements, sub-movements, lines of thought, discourses, etc. seems like something that they would totally do, I would hope that the Foundation Art Person would at least attempt to give a more nuanced approach. NEEDS MORE WORDS is what I'm saying, really.</p>

							</div>

								
					
